// Turtle System 2 (55/20)
//
// The Turtles' slower channel: enter on a 55-bar breakout, leave on a 20-bar reversal.
// Longer than the 20/10 variant, so it holds trends further and gives back more at the end.
//
// Both Turtle systems are in the library on purpose — run them side by side and the
// difference between them is a lesson about holding period that no single backtest teaches.
strategy("Turtle 55/20", overlay = true)

[hi, mid, lo]    = donchian(55)
[xHi, xMid, xLo] = donchian(20)

plot(hi, title = "55 high", color = color.mute)
plot(xLo, title = "20 low", color = color.s2)

if close > hi[1]
    strategy.entry("turtle", strategy.long)

if close < xLo[1]
    strategy.close("turtle")
